:1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"yoQBK3OUDqWEFoUDE5lM4w","review_id":"u0xTFnn6F-YptakIv4GUZQ","date":"2019-08-26T15:38:36","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9401394724845886,"text_excerpt":"The food and the service here was really great. For starters we had the trio and i loved the crabclaws in gravy- that gravy was really incredible. Reminded me of home. I had the jambalaya omelette, and my bother got the crab omelette. Both were really good, came together really well and very delish. I recommend the royal margs for drinks. And also the beignet fries, they are incredible. Come with bananas and caramel and are the perfect size for a shared dessert. Wait staff was good too, but didnt really make good recommendations, I guess they get a lot of tourists with a variety of tastes. Place looks a little old school but as long as the food is good, it doesnt have a big impact on me. ..."},{"business_id":"yoQBK3OUDqWEFoUDE5lM4w","review_id":"K19R7bMUZDrCrzcfR15jFg","date":"2016-06-21T19:07:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9368200898170471,"text_excerpt":"We popped in for lunch after a tour ended nearby, and had no expectations other than \"can we get some New Orleans style food here?\" since it was our first day. We'd heard of Antoine's Restaurant and must have gotten it confused. Anyway, it was a happy accident because we had a very decent meal here. First off, the service is great. The decor is a little old and in need of freshening up, but the warm welcome from our host and quick first visit by our server was enough to lure us in and set off our experience on a good foot. I ordered the Gumbo Duo and the Crawfish and Crabcakes, and my fiance ordered the Etouffee half and half with Shrimp Creole. We also got beers and a bloody mary and a d..."},{"business_id":"yoQBK3OUDqWEFoUDE5lM4w","review_id":"g_SwNDMf6_noerMNMHqIGg","date":"2019-06-29T05:24:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9326988458633423,"text_excerpt":"We chose this spot because it was late and was still serving food. The food was hit or miss. Nothing was great but nothing was bad either. I would recommend the gumbo if you come here. That was probably the best item. What made the experience good was actually the staff. The woman who greeted and sat us was very inviting and our server, Beau, was so incredibly nice and fun to chat with. You could tell he loves his city!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"yoQBK3OUDqWEFoUDE5lM4w","photo_id":"VbuVl48QjMGOJwqQYFPkOQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/VbuVl48QjMGOJwqQYFPkOQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.895840048789978},{"business_id":"yoQBK3OUDqWEFoUDE5lM4w","photo_id":"6rZSEof3-9mnA__yE5oUdw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/6rZSEof3-9mnA__yE5oUdw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8645489811897278},{"business_id":"yoQBK3OUDqWEFoUDE5lM4w","photo_id":"vDyGPxpNFjWA75ICHVqrrQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/vDyGPxpNFjWA75ICHVqrrQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8588225841522217},{"business_id":"yoQBK3OUDqWEFoUDE5lM4w","photo_id":"FP3ybc98R0q8tKMG1DhLqw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/FP3ybc98R0q8tKMG1DhLqw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7774623036384583},{"business_id":"yoQBK3OUDqWEFoUDE5lM4w","photo_id":"wTavdM_vMFDrmD29kEqYHw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/wTavdM_vMFDrmD29kEqYHw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7681905031204224}]},"notebook_case":null}
